OL,3,GNEWSAFunding secured for armed forces
OL,4,Asupport hub
OL,5,
OL,6,FA new support centre for veterans
OL,7,Fserving personnel and their families
OL,8,Fwill open in York after the council
OL,9,Fsecured more than #600,000 in
OL,10,Fgovernment funding.
OL,12,FThe hub, which will be based at the
OL,13,Fcouncil's West Offices site, will act
OL,14,Fas a point for the military community
OL,15,Fto get help with issues including
OL,16,Fhousing, employment, skills and
OL,17,Fwellbeing.
OL,23,APub: 09-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
