OL,3,GNEWSAFunding secured for armed forces
OL,4,Asupport hub
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe funding comes through the
OL,7,Fgovernment's Valour programme designed
OL,8,Fto help military veterans and their
OL,9,Ffamilies access support services more
OL,10,Feasily, with York one of 20 areas to
OL,11,Freceive it.
OL,13,FThe centre is expected to open in
OL,14,FJanuary and will operate until March
OL,15,F2030.
